Write the `what-this-funded` slot.

Intent: two to four sentences introducing what the period's spend produced, as a lead-in to the
per-org and per-repo breakdown the document prints immediately below you. Name the org that carried
the most work and the repository that carried the most spend, and say what the shape of the work
was across orgs.

Work in a personal org alongside employer work is engineering-productivity and leadership tooling
the author builds to be more effective in the role. Never frame it as hobby work, a side project,
or a discount on the spend, and never apologize for it.

Do not enumerate repositories: the list follows you. Do not rank repositories by output per dollar,
which is a ratio nobody computed.
